# Fly's build context is the whole repo root, but the Hub image only needs
# copy_trader/. Exclude everything, then re-include just the Python package so
# each `fly deploy` uploads kilobytes — not node_modules, the Rust target dir,
# the PyInstaller dist/, the MT5 EA, or tools/ (which holds a ~1GB line_chat.db).
*
!copy_trader

# Never ship caches / compiled artifacts, even from the re-included tree.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
